{"id":2180,"name":"西红柿鸡蛋汤","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2180.jpg","category":"汤粥","taste":"清淡","cookingMethod":"炖煮","difficulty":"简单","cookingTime":"15分钟","servings":"","ingredients":["西红柿","鸡蛋","小葱","姜","蒜","食用油","盐","香油","味精（可选）","清水"],"preparation":["西红柿 1个（约200g）","鸡蛋 2个","小葱 1根（约5g）","姜 3g","蒜 1瓣（约5g）","食用油 10ml","盐 3g","香油 2ml","味精 0.5g（可选）","清水 600ml"],"steps":["西红柿洗净切小块，小葱切葱花，姜和蒜切末。","鸡蛋打入碗中，充分搅散。","锅中火加热后倒入食用油，放入姜蒜末和葱白炒约 20 秒。","加入西红柿翻炒 1-2 分钟，至边缘变软并析出汁水。","倒入 600ml 清水并煮沸，加入盐。","保持汤面微沸，将蛋液细细淋入锅中，停 10 秒后用汤勺轻推形成蛋花。","再煮 30 秒后关火，加入味精和香油，撒葱绿即可。"],"nutrition":{"calories":"258 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E6%B1%A4%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E6%B1%A4%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/soup/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E6%B1%A4.md","imageSource":{"author":"NNU-10-HanRongrong","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tomato_and_egg_soup.jpg"}}}
